flowchart TD
    Start[Start wizard] --> Header[Print welcome + working dir]
    Header --> DetectAmber[Detect AMBERHOME & tools]
    DetectAmber --> CubeSize[Ask cube size 1 or 3 numbers]
    CubeSize --> SystemType{System type?\n1 solute_solvent\n2 mixture}

    %% Solute branch
    SystemType -- solute_solvent --> SoluteCount[Ask solute species count]
    SoluteCount --> SoluteLoop[[For each solute i]]
    SoluteLoop --> SolutePath[Ask solute file path xyz/pdb, must exist]
    SolutePath --> SoluteName[Ask solute short name]
    SoluteName --> AutoDetect[Auto-detect type: molecule / TMC / complex]
    AutoDetect --> SoluteClass{Classify solute\n1 regular\n2 TMC\n3 complex}

    SoluteClass -- regular --> MolCharge[Ask total charge int, default 0]
    MolCharge --> MolSpin[Ask spin multiplicity default 1]
    MolSpin --> SoluteNumber[Ask solute copies]
    SoluteNumber --> MolParams{Have frcmod/mol2/lib/off/prep?}
    MolParams -- yes --> MolFrcmod[Ask frcmod path optional] --> MolMainParam[Ask one of mol2/off/lib/prep] --> Centering
    MolParams -- no --> Centering

    SoluteClass -- TMC --> TmcCharge[Ask total charge default 0]
    TmcCharge --> TmcSpin[Ask spin multiplicity default 1]
    TmcSpin --> SoluteNumber
    SoluteNumber --> TmcMetalCharge[Ask metal charge]
    TmcMetalCharge --> TmcChargefile[Ask optional ligand charge file]
    TmcChargefile --> TmcCutoff[Ask cutoff distance default 2.8 Å]
    TmcCutoff --> Centering

    SoluteClass -- complex --> ComplexFrag{PDB?}
    ComplexFrag -- yes --> FragSummary[Summarize fragments/copies/atoms]
    FragSummary --> FragCharges[Ask fragment charges per residue]
    FragCharges --> SoluteNumber
    ComplexFrag -- no --> SoluteNumber

    SoluteNumber --> Centering{Center this solute?}
    Centering --> NextSolute[[Next solute or exit loop]]
    NextSolute --> SoluteLoop
    SoluteClass -.-> Centering

    %% QM settings if any TMC
    SoluteLoop -->|after loop| MaybeQM{Any transition metal complex?}
    MaybeQM -- yes --> QMSoftware[Detect & list QM software]
    QMSoftware --> QMChoose[Choose QM software]
    QMChoose --> QMExe[Path to QM executable optional]
    QMExe --> QMBasis[Ask basis set default lanl2dz]
    QMBasis --> QMMethod[Ask method default b3lyp]
    QMMethod --> QMProcs[Ask nprocs]
    QMProcs --> QMMaxcore[If ORCA: ask maxcore]
    QMMaxcore --> QMOpt[Ask run geometry opt?]
    QMOpt --> AmberHome[Ask/confirm AMBERHOME]
    MaybeQM -- no --> SolventCount
    AmberHome --> SolventCount

    %% Solvent branch
    SystemType -- mixture --> SolventCount
    SolventCount[Ask solvent/component count] --> Method{If >1: choose composition method\n1 number /2 weight /3 volume /4 molar\nIf single: 1 number or 2 density}

    Method --> SolventLoop[[For each component j]]
    SolventLoop --> SolventChoice{Preset solvent or custom?}
    SolventChoice -- preset --> SolventPreset[Set defaults mw, density, residue]
    SolventChoice -- custom --> CustomPath[Ask structure file must exist]
    CustomPath --> CustomResidue[Ask residue name]
    CustomResidue --> CustomParams{Have frcmod?}
    CustomParams -- yes --> CustomFrcmod[Ask frcmod path]
    CustomFrcmod --> CustomMainParam[Ask one of mol2/off/lib/prep] --> CompMethod
    CustomParams -- no --> CompMethod

    SolventPreset --> CompMethod
    CompMethod{Method?} -- 1 number --> SolvNumber[Ask molecule count]
    CompMethod -- single+density --> SolvDensity[Ask target density] --> SolvMW[Ask MW or auto] --> SolvCompute[Compute count from density]
    CompMethod -- ratios 2/3/4 --> SolvDensity2[Ask density] --> SolvMW2[Ask MW] --> SolvRatio[Ask weight/volume/molar ratio]

    SolvNumber --> NextSolvent[[Next component or exit loop]]
    SolvCompute --> NextSolvent
    SolvRatio --> NextSolvent
    SolvMW --> SolvCompute
    SolvMW2 --> SolvRatio
    NextSolvent --> SolventLoop

    SolventLoop -->|after loop| RatioCalc{If multi-component + ratios}
    RatioCalc -- yes --> CalcNumbers[Compute molecule counts from ratios]
    RatioCalc -- no --> SkipRatio
    CalcNumbers --> SkipRatio
    SkipRatio --> DensityCheck

    %% Density sanity
    DensityCheck[Estimate overall & solvent-only density] --> DensityDev{Deviation check}
    DensityDev -- ok --> Packmol
    DensityDev -- adjust --> AdjustChoice{Adjust?\n1 cube size\n2 scale solvent counts\n3 keep}
    AdjustChoice -- 1 --> PreviewCube[Preview new cube size] --> ApplyCube{Apply?}
    ApplyCube --> Packmol
    AdjustChoice -- 2 --> PreviewCounts[Preview scaled solvent counts] --> ApplyCounts{Apply?}
    ApplyCounts --> Packmol
    AdjustChoice -- 3 --> Packmol

    %% Packmol + output
    Packmol[Suggest packmol closeness preset if single known solvent and ask override] --> OutFolder[Ask output folder]
    OutFolder --> Review[Show config JSON]
    Review --> WriteNow{Write now?}
    WriteNow -- yes --> Save[Save generated_input.json]
    WriteNow -- no --> EditMode[Edit via python expressions]
    EditMode --> Save
    Save --> End[End]